        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö kikiyitïtö pipö Lawi ortïnekwa chinö walaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kilenchï ECHOTYON Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Meyitïtö akonga pipö Lawi ato iyitenyi pich Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo tönö Lawi kïrip Ema Santuku Muma* nko karichi löwïr, akïsïtöy Santuku muma nko tïkuchi löwïr, aikany kïmang chane kuwit Ema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Otini kowuwökwa möngenkwa, pipö Lawi cho ngetöy Ema akï chane cho teköy ato omöngisyekwa ngat. Kïpöröy chi anka tïkwïl nyo sis nyo riköy Ema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teköy pipö Israel emenikwa kïpegha söpïchis, chi nko söpïchtanyi kïrïp kegh nko ortinekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo möngöy pipö Lawi kuwit Ema Santuku Muma atökïrïp tömötöp ntökïrik chi akwigh nyölotyenyan kïpar pipö Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 1:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwigh nyu pipö Israel le ato kimwochï ECHOTYON Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.1.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.1.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kakïtat ortïn ompö möngot",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
